{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39578","headline":"寄舍弟承裕员外 · 翁承赞","name":"寄舍弟承裕员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江花岸草晚萋萋，公子王孙思合迷。\n无主园林饶采伐，忘情鸥鸟恣高低。\n长江月上鱼翻鬣，荒圃人稀獭印蹄。\n何事斜阳再回首，休愁离别岘山西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}